# Server-side only — deliberately not VITE_-prefixed so it's never bundled
# into client JS. Set this in your Vercel project's Environment Variables
# (Settings > Environment Variables), and for local testing in a `.env`
# file used with `vercel dev` (plain `npm run dev` does not serve /api).
#
# Get a free key at https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=
